--- !u!114 &477622806
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 477622805}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a54302a803bd968bfb7404e1aac90c9e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ForestTutorialController
  m_InputHandler: {fileID: 1223839985}
  m_DialogueProcessor: {fileID: 1333119863}
  m_EyeModeController: {fileID: 286797795}
  m_TypewriterDisplay: {fileID: 884333447}
  m_NoFairyVariationIndex: 0
  m_FairyOnlyVariationIndex: 1
  m_FairyAndFragmentVariationIndex: 2
  m_FairyPrompt1_ExplainEyeOpen: "You hear a small voice close to your ear. \n\n\"Wait,
    what are you doing wandering around like that? You're not going to get very far
    in this place with your eyes closed.\"\n\n\"Why don't you try OPENING your EYES?
    You may get a bit further that way.\"\n\nWhat do you do?"
  m_FairyPrompt2_TryAgain: 'You hear the small voice in your ear again...


    "Why
    didn''t you talk to me? Did you not see me or something? I swear that I''m here!
    Things aren''t always as they seem at first glance; the Illusionist is tricky
    that way.


    Open your eyes again, I''ll be there. I promise."


    What
    do you do?'
  m_FairyPrompt3_TakeFragment: 'You hear the small voice in your ear once more...


    "There,
    see? Now -- the Illusionist keeps himself locked in his Tower and unfortunately
    there''s a large glyph he uses to ward off intruders. There are Fragments to
    dispel the glyph scattered throughout the surrounding lands.


    As it just
    so happens though, I''m carrying one of the Fragment you''ll be needing. Did
    you see it before? Maybe not. Try opening your eyes again, maybe you''ll see
    it this time."


    What do you do?'
  m_FairyPrompt4_YouSawIt: 'You hear the small voice in your ear once again....


    "You
    saw the Fragment, right? Good. Now you should be able to TAKE it from me. It''s
    impossible to interact with things you can''t see..."


    What do you do?'
  m_FairyPrompt5_VentureToGlade: 'You can faintly hear the small voice in your ear...


    "Good,
    but that is just the first of 5 Fragments. You''ll need to steel your courage
    and venture further into the Forest.


    If you MOVE deeper, you should come
    across a Glade. I''d make that MY next stop, if I were a Hero like you."


    What
    do you do?'
  m_FairyPrompt1SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01d79b620857f88ee934961ab8defc64, type: 3}
  m_FairyPrompt2SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01d79b620857f88ee934961ab8defc64, type: 3}
  m_FairyPrompt3SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01d79b620857f88ee934961ab8defc64, type: 3}
  m_FairyPrompt4SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01d79b620857f88ee934961ab8defc64, type: 3}
  m_FairyPrompt5SFX: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01d79b620857f88ee934961ab8defc64, type: 3}
  m_Fallback1_EyeOpen: '"What are you doing? Are you stupid? You won''t be able to
    get around with your eyes closed.


    Just try to OPEN your EYES."


    What
    do you do?'
  m_Fallback2_EyeOpen: '"No no, do you have some gunk in your eyes? Did you sleep
    too hard and forget to remove your little eye crusties?


    OPEN your EYES
    again, and see if you can see me this time."


    What do you do?'
  m_Fallback3_EyeOpen: '"Foolish Hero, you can''t take what you can''t see.


    OPEN
    your EYES again and lay eyes on the Fragment."


    What do you do?'
  m_Fallback4_TakeFragment: '"If I thought you were foolish before, I KNOW you are
    now.


    You''re a Hero, right? Aren''t you stupposed to be smart or something?
    Or is being courageous all you need these days?


    TAKE it. TAKE the FRAGMENT
    from me."


    What do you do?'
  m_Fallback5_Glade: '"What are you doing? There''s nothing left for you here.


    The
    only way forward is through. MOVE it! MOVE towards the GLADE!"


    ...the Fairy
    seems fed up with you.


    What do you do?'
